# Install OUTSIDE the kit at /etc/paperclip-hermes/backup.env, root:root 0600.
# Parent directory root:root 0700. Literal, unquoted values; never source/export.
# Generate the age identity OFF HOST; copy only its native age1... recipient.
BACKUP_AGE_RECIPIENT=
# Full HTTPS CONTAINER SAS URL. sr=c, spr=https, si=<stored access policy>.
# Policy permissions MUST be Create and Write only. No Read/List/Delete.
# Azure can omit sp when the stored policy defines it; if present, sp=cw only.
BACKUP_CONTAINER_SAS_URL=
